lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231361\">あのおいしいワインをなぜ<ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まないんだい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为什么不尝尝那美味的酒?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アパート</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">公寓楼；公寓大楼；公寓；套房</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176617\"><ruby>兄<rp>(</rp><rt>あに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はアパートをさがしています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我弟弟在寻找一个公寓</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あびる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">浇在身上；淋浴；冲淋；晒（太阳）；沐浴在……中；满身是……；遭受；招致；引来；蒙受</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209749\">その<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はシャワーを<ruby>浴<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我当时在淋浴。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/10304779\" title=\"Tatoeba · DaoSeng\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · DaoSeng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">危ない</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あぶない</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">危险的；有风险的；危急的；险峻的；不稳妥的；处于危险中；危在旦夕；情况严重的；岌岌可危的；不确定的；不可靠的；无把握的；不稳定的；靠不住的；千钧一发的；侥幸的；勉强的；可疑的；不正当的；不正经的；小心！当心！注意！危险！</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183713\"><ruby>間一髪<rp>(</rp><rt>かんいっぱつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>！<ruby>危<rp>(</rp><rt>あぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ないところでした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">电话打得很紧</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">甘い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あまい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">甜的；甜味的；含糖的；芳香的；悦耳的；口味清淡的；少盐的；不辣的；天真的；过于乐观的；心软的；宽容的；纵容的；好说话的；宽松的；敷衍的；不彻底的；没做完的；不足的；不充分的；不到位的；松弛的；温和的；柔和的；诱人的；有诱惑力的；引诱人的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194851\">メアリーにはつい<ruby>甘<rp>(</rp><rt>あま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなってしまう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我心里对玛丽一直很温柔</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あまり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">剩余；残余；剩下的；余数；盈余；饭菜剩余；不很；不太；不怎么；太；过于；过分；极端的；巨大的；严重的；惊人的；可怕的；不太好；马马虎虎；平庸的；以上；超过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221356\">この<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあまり<ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不太会读这种书</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">雨</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">雨；雨天；阴雨天气；花札十一月组</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"80133\"><ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のおかげで<ruby>雨<rp>(</rp><rt>あめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にぬれずにすんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">树让我没有下雨</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">飴</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">硬糖；太妃糖；米糖；用米、土豆等淀粉制成的糖；琥珀色；黄褐色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"139909\"><ruby>息子<rp>(</rp><rt>むすこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>箱<rp>(</rp><rt>はこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>飴<rp>(</rp><rt>あめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>一<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我儿子从盒子里拿了个糖果</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">洗う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あらう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">洗；冲洗；漂洗；追查；调查；追究；净化（心灵）；洗涤（心灵）；冲刷；拍打；席卷</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228970\">いつこの<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>洗<rp>(</rp><rt>あら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>われましたか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这辆车什么时候洗的?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ありがとう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谢谢；感谢</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197814\">はるばる<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てくれてありがとう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你大老远跑来真好</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ある</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">存在；有；有；拥有；位于；坐落于；配备有；装有；发生；出现；（以完成状态）存在；保持现状</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"77204\"><ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があったら<ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をかけて<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果你想和我说话,请打电话给我</span></div></li>"]